# Settings > Screen > Idle dim level, Terminal text size, Screen size at 320x480 (profile p320: no clipping on the
# narrowest screen): the section, the three lists with their hints and notes. Review only.
title p320 settings screen prefs
review
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_BOARD pi3a-luckfox35
backlight levels
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key ENTER
wait 300
shot p320_prefs_section
# Brightness, DarkTime, PDA mode (offered on this profile), then the three rows
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
shot p320_prefs_dim
key ESC
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
shot p320_prefs_term
key ESC
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
shot p320_prefs_size
